---
const questions = [
  { q: 'What kinds of websites do you create?', a: 'Business websites, landing pages, and redesigns for small businesses. The right direction depends on what you need the site to do.' },
  { q: 'Can we work together remotely?', a: 'Yes. Quadra Holdings is based in Saudi Arabia and available to work online with businesses worldwide.' },
  { q: 'How is pricing decided?', a: 'Pricing depends on the scope of the project, the number of pages, and any features needed. Quotes are tailored to each project.' },
  { q: 'What should I have ready before getting in touch?', a: 'You can start with your idea and any content you already have. We can discuss the pages and materials your project needs.' },
];
---
<section class="widget-panel faq-widget reveal" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="widget-heading"><div><span class="widget-kicker">A FEW HELPFUL ANSWERS</span><h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Ask a question <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="faq-list">{questions.map((item, i) => <details class="faq-item"><summary><span class="faq-number">0{i + 1}</span><span>{item.q}</span><span class="faq-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>{item.a}</p></div></details>)}</div>
</section>
